wq45xno?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">From first dates to speed dating, saunas have become a popular place to meet a new partner.</summary></entry><entry><title>How a phone call 40 years ago changed Ice Age history</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cvgl7710n44zo#3</id><updated>2026-09-27T19:49:23Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T06:29:25Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cvgl7710n44zo--5a99705ebd28.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cvgl7710n44zo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">A phone call is seen as "absolutely crucial" in discovering the truth about Britain's mammoths.</summary></entry><entry><title>'I went from bouncer with fists ready to town mayor'</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c687vn9w5z5lo#3</id><updated>2026-09-27T19:49:23Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T05:40:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c687vn9w5z5lo--e55dcf106f94.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/c687vn9w5z5lo?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">He says that, as a bouncer, he received death threats which caused him to leave the profession.</summary></entry><entry><title>The tiger that stunned a seaside town</title><id>https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmde0wdl7d5po#3</id><updated>2026-09-27T19:49:23Z</updated><published>2026-09-27T06:13:58Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmde0wdl7d5po--acf1a5b84c38.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmde0wdl7d5po?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">Plassey the tiger arrived in Kent with the Royal Madras Fusiliers and was kept as a regimental pet.</summary></entry><entry><title>England win series as Banton delivers on potential</title><id>h